<title>ITALY: Italy plans long-term yen Eurobond - Treasury.</title>
<headline>Italy plans long-term yen Eurobond - Treasury.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy plans to launch a long-term yen-denominated Eurobond with Nikko Europe acting as bookruuner for the issue, the Italian Treasury said in a statement on Monday. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
